OL,3,AZelensky has 'questions to answer'
OL,4,Aabout corruption in his government,
OL,5,Asacked minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,8,Fhas "questions to answer" about
OL,9,Fcorruption in his government, his
OL,10,Fsacked defence minister Mykhailo
OL,11,FFedorov has told the BBC.
OL,13,FFedorov, a popular minister who
OL,14,Fmodernised the armed forces and
OL,15,Fpioneered drone warfare, was fired last
OL,16,Fmonth after reportedly falling out with
OL,17,Fthe head of Ukraine's armed forces.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
